      "summaries": {
        "en": "DeepSeek-TUI is a terminal-based coding agent that brings DeepSeek models directly into your command line, eliminating the need for a web interface. Built in Rust, it leverages TUI (Terminal User Interface) for a fast, keyboard-driven workflow. Its key strength is seamless integration with local or remote DeepSeek models, enabling code generation, debugging, and file editing without leaving the terminal. Developers can use it to accelerate coding tasks, automate repetitive edits, or experiment with LLM-powered assistance in a lightweight, privacy-focused environment.",
        "zh": "DeepSeek-TUI 是一个运行在终端中的编码助手，专为 DeepSeek 模型设计，让你无需离开命令行就能调用大模型。它用 Rust 编写，利用终端用户界面（TUI）实现纯键盘操作，响应迅速。核心亮点是直接对接 DeepSeek 模型，支持代码生成、调试和文件编辑，无需图形界面。开发者可以把它集成到日常开发流程中，比如快速生成代码片段、自动化重构，或者作为隐私优先的本地编程助手。想体验纯终端的大模型编程？试试这个项目，感受 Rust 带来的轻量与高效。",
        "es": "DeepSeek-TUI is a terminal-based coding agent that brings DeepSeek models directly into your command line, eliminating the need for a web interface. Built in Rust, it leverages TUI (Terminal User Interface) for a fast, keyboard-driven workflow. Its key strength is seamless integration with local or remote DeepSeek models, enabling code generation, debugging, and file editing without leaving the terminal. Developers can use it to accelerate coding tasks, automate repetitive edits, or experiment with LLM-powered assistance in a lightweight, privacy-focused environment.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "DeepSeek-TUI stands out for cli, deepseek, and llm in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "DeepSeek-TUI is a terminal-based coding agent that brings DeepSeek models directly into your command line, eliminating the need for a web interface. Built in Rust, it leverages TUI (Terminal User Interface) for a fast, keyboard-driven workflow. Its key strength is seamless integration with local or remote DeepSeek models, enabling code generation, debugging, and file editing without leaving the terminal. Developers can use it to accelerate coding tasks, automate repetitive edits, or experiment with LLM-powered assistance in a lightweight, privacy-focused environment.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/Hmbown/DeepSeek-TUI for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
