      "summaries": {
        "en": "Qwen3.6-35B-A3B is a multimodal MoE model that processes both images and text for conversational AI. Its key innovation is a mixture-of-experts architecture with 35B total parameters but only 3B activated per token, enabling high performance with lower compute. Technically, it uses sparse activation and shared expert layers for efficiency. Practically, you can deploy it via Hugging Face Transformers for tasks like visual question answering or image captioning, or fine-tune it for domain-specific multimodal applications.",
        "zh": "Qwen3.6-35B-A3B是一个多模态MoE模型，可同时处理图像与文本进行对话。其核心创新在于混合专家架构：总参数量35B，但每个token仅激活3B参数，通过稀疏激活与共享专家层实现高性能与低计算成本的平衡。技术上采用动态路由机制选择专家，并支持图像与文本的联合编码。可通过Hugging Face Transformers直接部署，用于视觉问答、图像描述等任务；也可针对医疗影像分析、电商图文检索等场景微调。该模型适合需同时理解视觉与语言信息的应用，且Apache-2.0许可证允许商业使用。",
        "es": "Qwen3.6-35B-A3B is a multimodal MoE model that processes both images and text for conversational AI. Its key innovation is a mixture-of-experts architecture with 35B total parameters but only 3B activated per token, enabling high performance with lower compute. Technically, it uses sparse activation and shared expert layers for efficiency. Practically, you can deploy it via Hugging Face Transformers for tasks like visual question answering or image captioning, or fine-tune it for domain-specific multimodal applications.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "Qwen3.6-35B-A3B stands out for transformers, safetensors, and qwen3_5_moe in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Qwen3.6-35B-A3B is a multimodal MoE model that processes both images and text for conversational AI. Its key innovation is a mixture-of-experts architecture with 35B total parameters but only 3B activated per token, enabling high performance with lower compute. Technically, it uses sparse activation and shared expert layers for efficiency. Practically, you can deploy it via Hugging Face Transformers for tasks like visual question answering or image captioning, or fine-tune it for domain-specific multimodal applications.",
          "how": "Review https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
